{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30198","headline":"君不见 · 薛逢","name":"君不见","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见，马侍中，气吞河朔称英雄。\n君不见，韦太尉，二十年前镇蜀地。\n一朝冥漠归下泉，功业胜名两憔悴。\n奉诚园里篙棘生，长兴街南沙路平。\n当时带砺在何处，今日子孙无地耕。\n或闻羁旅甘常调，簿尉文参各天表。\n清明纵便天使来，一把纸钱风树杪。\n碑文半缺碑堂摧，祁连塚象狐兔开。\n野花似雪落何处，棠棃树下香风来。\n马侍中，韦太尉，盛去衰来片时事。\n人生倏忽一梦中，何必深深固权位。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30198.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30198","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}